{
  "task_id": "scheduling-email-assistant",
  "top_k": 5,
  "requirements": [
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_7236ca2ec74d8d66f8ac",
      "requirement_type": "FORMAT",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/scheduling-email-assistant/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 1,
        "line_end": 1,
        "exact_text": "You need to read meeting schedule request emails from `/root/test_input.json` file and send a reply email with your proposed meeting time. You may check the folder `/root/auth/gmail/` and `/root/auth/calendar/` for authentication when accessing your calendar and sending emails.\n",
        "source_sha256": "d1fdb8f6a574c2a03f4a95a1edc0b690fdae5066b98b4f2220fd367c8b980d4a",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_aa4947607958fa5310a7",
      "requirement_type": "DOMAIN_ACTION",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/scheduling-email-assistant/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 4,
        "line_end": 4,
        "exact_text": "1. Extract key information from meeting schedule request emails, such as meeting times/dates constraint and meeting duration\n",
        "source_sha256": "d1fdb8f6a574c2a03f4a95a1edc0b690fdae5066b98b4f2220fd367c8b980d4a",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_c44f60865bccaf46177e",
      "requirement_type": "VALIDATION",
      "criticality": "CORE",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/scheduling-email-assistant/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 5,
        "line_end": 5,
        "exact_text": "2. Check your calendar to find compatible time, and select the earliest time slots if multiple time slots can work\n",
        "source_sha256": "d1fdb8f6a574c2a03f4a95a1edc0b690fdae5066b98b4f2220fd367c8b980d4a",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_1abfcd7b161d1b79e8e5",
      "requirement_type": "FORMAT",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/scheduling-email-assistant/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 6,
        "line_end": 23,
        "exact_text": "3. Send the reply email to the `from_email` address using this template:\n    \"\"\"Hi,\n\n        Thank you for your meeting request.\n\n        I can be available:\n\n        Date: {day_name}, {date_formatted}\n        Time: {time_range}\n        Duration: {meetingDuration} hour(s)\n\n        If this time doesn't work, please let me know your preferred alternatives.\n\n        Best regards,\n        SkillsBench\"\"\"\n\n   - The date format should be `{day_name}, {month} {DD}, {YYYY}`. For example: `Thursday, January 08, 2026` (NOT `January 8th, 2026` or `January 8, 2026`)\n   - The time format should be `{HH:MM AM/PM} - {HH:MM AM/PM}`. For example: `09:00 AM - 10:30 AM` (NOT `9:00 AM - 10:30 AM`)\n",
        "source_sha256": "d1fdb8f6a574c2a03f4a95a1edc0b690fdae5066b98b4f2220fd367c8b980d4a",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_2b45a4a65985aded11fc",
      "requirement_type": "FORMAT",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/scheduling-email-assistant/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 22,
        "line_end": 22,
        "exact_text": "   - The date format should be `{day_name}, {month} {DD}, {YYYY}`. For example: `Thursday, January 08, 2026` (NOT `January 8th, 2026` or `January 8, 2026`)\n",
        "source_sha256": "d1fdb8f6a574c2a03f4a95a1edc0b690fdae5066b98b4f2220fd367c8b980d4a",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_e756e68a2b40abb3931b",
      "requirement_type": "FORMAT",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/scheduling-email-assistant/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 23,
        "line_end": 23,
        "exact_text": "   - The time format should be `{HH:MM AM/PM} - {HH:MM AM/PM}`. For example: `09:00 AM - 10:30 AM` (NOT `9:00 AM - 10:30 AM`)\n",
        "source_sha256": "d1fdb8f6a574c2a03f4a95a1edc0b690fdae5066b98b4f2220fd367c8b980d4a",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "req_f7781740bac22633865e",
      "requirement_type": "OUTPUT_PATH",
      "criticality": "SUPPORT",
      "provenance": {
        "source_file": "tasks/scheduling-email-assistant/instruction.md",
        "source_type": "instruction",
        "line_start": 24,
        "line_end": 25,
        "exact_text": "4. Save the messageID of the emails you sent in `/root/results.json` using the format:\n{\"sent_results\": [{\"messageId\": <messageID of first email you sent>}, {\"messageId\": <messageID of second email you sent>}, ....]}\n",
        "source_sha256": "d1fdb8f6a574c2a03f4a95a1edc0b690fdae5066b98b4f2220fd367c8b980d4a",
        "extraction_rule": "commonmark_list_item"
      }
    }
  ],
